WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.768
-You started in stand-up.
You still do stand-up.

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know you were just in Vegas
doing stand-up.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:06.473
-I was. I was with David Spade.
-David Spade, a very funny guy.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's hysterical.
Me and David were at the --

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:10.577
You know what, I got to tell
what you happened in Vegas.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:13.780
This is funny. Years ago,
before I was doing "AGT,"

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hosted a game show
called "Deal or No Deal."

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:17.817 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And "Deal or No Deal"...

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Scattered cheers
and applause ]

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.454 line:92%
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:22.155 line:92%
I'm holding for applause.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you can fill in
more later. Right?

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.926 size:88% position:44%
-Yeah, we'll just put...
-Oh, sit down. Sit down!

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
That's crazy.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wasn't expecting
this kind of response.

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:34.567
But -- so they have
"Deal or No Deal" slot machines

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the casino.
And we went there,

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:39.439
my wife was with me,
and we went with another couple,

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
Louie and Kathy.
And they were downstairs

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the casino, and before
the show, I stay in the room.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:45.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
My wife calls me in the room
and said,

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:46.746 line:92%
"Howie, you've got to see this.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:49.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
Louie was playing
the 'Deal or No Deal' machine,

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:52.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
he hit the jackpot
and won $10,000."

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:53.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fantastic.
-"You've got to see that."

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:54.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "Well, that's great!"
I put on my coat,

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:58.124
I ran out of my room, down
the hall, into the elevator.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:58.792 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Across the whole casino,

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:01.561
I see the lights going off on
the "Deal or No Deal" machine.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
His wife is crying.
They're peeling off hundreds.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.131 line:92%
They're giving her $100,000.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.734
I go and give them a hug,
and this is life-changing.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
$10,000. And I notice
there's lights

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a crowd around me
and I look,

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:12.672 line:92%
and people are taking pictures.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:16.476
And then I realize they have
no idea that this is my friend.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:19.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
People think that
if you hit the jackpot...

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:24.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
...on the "Deal or No Deal"
machine, I show up.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:29.089 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you, thank you.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:32.459
So I looked at them, and I went,
"Oh, somebody just hit in Reno!"

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:33.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I went and then --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.563
You can see in the distance
the whole crowd moving over

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:40.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the "Wheel of Fortune"
machine, awaiting Pat Sajak.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, of course.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-So this is very exciting.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.704
This is the twelfth season
of "America's got talent."

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:46.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
So your sixth season.
-Eight.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:47.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, it's eight for you.
-Eight.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you were doing
the Canadian exchange.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.610
I see what you were doing there.
-Yeah, I was shifting it back.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Our years.
-And first year with glasses

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
though for you.
-You know, you've noticed?

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:55.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You noticed.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:56.850 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You know what's weird?

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm an old guy and apparently
my wife said,

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:00.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
"When's the last time
you went to the optometrist?"

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:02.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've never been
to an optometrist.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I went this year.

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:07.460
And I don't think my --
my vision is no different

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.895 line:92%
than I've ever noticed it.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:11.231 line:92%
He said that I'm legally blind.

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:13.833 size:81% position:41%
These are very strong.
And I put them on --

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:14.434 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:17.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why does my inability to see
make you laugh?

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:18.438 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:19.305 line:92%
But now I have to wear glasses

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm wearing glasses
full-time.

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:22.142 line:92%
Not for reading, full time.

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:25.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was blind.
I was legally blind.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:26.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Wait.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I have been judging
a talent show for eight years.

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:31.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:35.255 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This...

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:36.189 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This...

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:38.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the first season
I've seen it!

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is so good!
-Yeah. Congratulations.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.028 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-It is so good.

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:44.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we're going live
this Tuesday

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:45.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm going to be
tweeting live.

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:47.567
Are you are you big on Twitter?
-Yeah.

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:50.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
-@HowieMandel.
I love to tweet live.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.338 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Follow me. Follow me.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:54.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're coming off a little
desperate right now.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:56.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're not --
you don't understand --

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The twitter thing was --
I was finished.

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm looking at people there
and I'm saying,

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the end of the show,
I'm going to be in the lobby.

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:07.620
And I want all of you to follow
me someplace, not on Twitter.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Just really, literally,

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:10.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want this --
-Yeah.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.926 size:88% position:44%
-Wouldn't it be great to
show back up in my hotel

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
with all of these people?
-Yeah.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just wait until the rest
of the show is over.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.097 size:84% position:42%
Don't follow him now.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:19.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can't wait.
That's very exciting

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you're doing
the live shows.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's great.
-It is very exciting.

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.938
At the Dolby Theatre live
Tuesdays and Wednesdays.

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:28.841
This year is more exciting
and better than any other year.

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:30.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, we got --
We have some superstars.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
Last year my Golden buzzer
won Grace VanderWaal,

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
this 12-year-old.
-She was fantastic.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.884
-A genius, songwriter,
performer who is going to be --

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:39.619 size:81% position:41%
I promise you still.
You know, she's, like,

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.654
number-one selling in Japan now.
-Oh, that's great.

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:45.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She had the number-one
downloading iTunes last year,

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:46.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
a single,
and she's just growing,

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:48.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this year,
I have another Golden buzzer.

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:51.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
This young boy, Christian,
is -- isn't that weird

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:53.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
that a Jew pressed a buzzer
for a Christian?

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.802
-That's good. I feel like
the worlds are coming together.

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:57.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's what I do.
-We need more of that.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's what I do.
-We need more of that.

00:03:58.438 --> 00:03:59.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much for
being here, Howie.

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.341
-Thank you for having me.
-Howie Mandel, everybody!

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:04.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
"America's Got Talent,"
Tuesdays and Wednesday nights

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:06.646 size:75% position:38% line:92%
at 8:00 here on NBC.

